WEBVTT

00:23:57.542 --> 00:24:01.393
I was wondering if there's any way
you could possibly make me a taco.

00:24:01.417 --> 00:24:03.018
Anthony: A taco?

00:24:03.042 --> 00:24:05.976
Well, actually, we wouldn't
have the ingredients here.

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:09.434
AG: Can you make, like,
a Cinnabon that looks like a softshell?

00:24:09.458 --> 00:24:11.184
Anthony: Yeah, I don't see why not.

00:24:11.208 --> 00:24:14.143
We could probably make a Cinnabon
that looks like a softshell.

00:24:14.167 --> 00:24:16.309
AG: I am a little
worried that if I come home

00:24:16.333 --> 00:24:17.934
with this taco-looking delicacy

00:24:17.958 --> 00:24:20.476
and then she tastes it
and it tastes like a Cinnabon,

00:24:20.500 --> 00:24:22.309
that she's still gonna be devastated.

00:24:22.333 --> 00:24:25.476
So the question is can I get you
to offer me this for free,

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:27.893
just in case, so that
I don't have to tell her

00:24:27.917 --> 00:24:30.375
that I paid for something
that was not a taco?